00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:01.901
-Here's how the game works.

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:03.069
One person puts on
these headphones

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:03.936
with loud music playing.

00:00:03.936 --> 00:00:05.037
You can play this game at home.

00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:07.106
Then the other person
picks up a card,

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:09.409
reads the random phrase
on that card.

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:10.810
And the person wearing
headphones

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.611
has to try guess
what they just said.

00:00:12.611 --> 00:00:15.081
Okay? Naomi, you can put
the headphones on first.

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:17.216
-Oh, okay. So you're first.
-Yeah.

00:00:17.216 --> 00:00:19.452
And I will then read you
my phrase.

